  "notes": [
    "**Aprender** is a regular **-ER verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **aprendido** (regular)",
    "Often used with \"a\" + infinitive: *aprender a nadar* (to learn to swim)",
    "Common usage: *aprender español* (to learn Spanish), *aprender de memoria* (to learn by heart/memorize)",
    "Related noun: **el aprendizaje** (learning), **el/la aprendiz** (apprentice/learner)",
